config DELUGE_SRAM
	tristate "Synthstrom Deluge userspace on-chip SRAM region"
	depends on ARCH_R7S72100 || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  Exposes a fixed on-chip SRAM carveout as /dev/deluge-sram, mmap-able
	  cached into userspace (the Spark synth) for hot DSP data such as
	  wavetables and delay lines: on-chip, never evicted by SDRAM traffic,
	  with a deterministic refill on a cache miss. A GET_INFO ioctl reports
	  the region's physical base and size.
